// The grotto: a cave under the glasshouse, lit blue by mushrooms, dripping.
//
// Drop in through the glasshouse floor onto the landing under the hole; ledges climb back to it.
// A Favour sits on a shelf high in the west wall, under a bloom, a jump from the top ledge.
